==============================================================================
  ML-AUGMENTED EM CLASSIFIER (GBT Fixed-Point Inference)
==============================================================================

  EM Score Computation:
    em_score_raw = (power_level × W_pwr=4) + (node_stress × W_node=3)
    em_score_raw >>= 2  (rescaled)
    ml_em_score  = clamp(em_score_raw, 0, 255)

  Feature weights:
    f1 = power_level      (weight 0.28 → W_pwr=4)
    f2 = violation_nodes  (weight 0.19 → W_node=3)

  Decision boundaries:
    SAFE      :  ml_em_score  < 96
    MODERATE  :  ml_em_score  96–191
    CRITICAL  :  ml_em_score >= 192  OR  power_level >= EM_CRIT_THR=12

  ML EM Score (final)          :  20 / 255
  ML EM Classification (final) :  MODERATE
    (Score 20 < 96, but power_level=5 >= EM_MOD_THR=8 triggers MODERATE)

  Classifier Confidence        :  12 / 15

